=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# updates screen-timer-off -------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: Auto Updates. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. apt-$
# daily-upgrade.timer disabled and stopped by the administrator.$
# Enable is offered, saying so, and refuses: hardn leaves apt's$
# timers alone.$
$
# Auto Updates #################################################$
$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured upgrade timer off$
$
# Update Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
   -  unattended-upgrades  Installed 2.12$
   -  Upgrades             Daily by 20auto-upgrades$
   -  Package Lists        Daily by 20auto-upgrades$
  [ ] Upgrade Timer        Off apt-daily-upgrade.timer$
   -  Lists Timer          On apt-daily.timer$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Enable automatic updates$
      Upgrade timer is off$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

